1
00:00:01,033 --> 00:00:03,433
[IMA] This house is huge, dear!

2
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:05,400
You fit right in!

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,533
- We hit the jackpot!
- [LAUGHS]

4
00:00:07,533 --> 00:00:11,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

5
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:12,700
Oh my god, guard!

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:16,200
I told you not to let
street urchins in!

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,267
- Street urchins?
- Street urchins?

8
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:20,133
You know what, here you go.
You may leave now.

9
00:00:20,133 --> 00:00:21,133
Hey!

10
00:00:21,133 --> 00:00:22,500
We're not beggars!

11
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,300
My father is the cousin
of the cousin

12
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:26,600
of the uncle of the cousin
of the nephew of the cousin

13
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,333
of the cousin's cousin
of Don Nato!

14
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:31,300
My daughter is so excellent.
[SMOOCHES]

15
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,633
- You better tell her!
- [SIGHS]

16
00:00:32,633 --> 00:00:34,233
Guard!

17
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:35,333
[SHERYN] Guard!

18
00:00:35,333 --> 00:00:37,233
Oh! I'm the guard.

19
00:00:37,233 --> 00:00:38,633
Let them in.
They're at the right place.

20
00:00:38,633 --> 00:00:41,800
This is Miss June Sampaga
and her mom.

21
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:44,700
But, Attorney, who's this
diva wannabe anyway?

22
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,467
How are you a wannabe
and stingy?

23
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:48,700
Is this face worth only
five pesos to you? Hmph!

24
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:51,533
This is Miss Sheryn Cruz.
The assistant of Don Nato.

25
00:00:51,533 --> 00:00:52,667
You'll be seeing her
most of the time

26
00:00:52,667 --> 00:00:55,467
because Don Nato's office
is actually situated here.

27
00:00:55,667 --> 00:00:57,067
[WHISPERS] An assistant...

28
00:00:58,467 --> 00:01:01,333
Please bring this
inside our house.

29
00:01:02,133 --> 00:01:03,167
Please?

30
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:06,600
Excuse me, it isn't yours yet.

31
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:08,200
Don't get carried away.

32
00:01:08,733 --> 00:01:10,233
And I'm sure...

33
00:01:10,433 --> 00:01:12,800
Ping won't like you anyway.

34
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,133
You're sure?

35
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,500
- [IMA MUTTERING]
- [JUNE] Uh...

36
00:01:16,500 --> 00:01:20,267
Attorney, is Ping my...
husband-to-be?

37
00:01:20,467 --> 00:01:21,433
[ZIA] Yes.

38
00:01:21,433 --> 00:01:22,767
Your future husband.

39
00:01:22,767 --> 00:01:29,067
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

40
00:01:29,067 --> 00:01:32,433
[CAR ENGINE REVVING]

41
00:01:33,333 --> 00:01:34,500
[CAR DOOR OPENS]

42
00:01:35,467 --> 00:01:42,367
[INTENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

43
00:01:43,467 --> 00:01:45,533
- Eh?
- Dear, why is he like that?

44
00:01:45,533 --> 00:01:47,867
Ma, you two
suit each other better!

45
00:01:47,867 --> 00:01:49,533
[WHISPERING] Hey,
watch your words!

46
00:01:49,533 --> 00:01:52,800
Uh, do we really need
to sleep beside each other?

47
00:01:52,800 --> 00:01:56,100
[ZIA] Oh, naturally!
He's your husband!

48
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,467
[GULPS]

49
00:01:58,367 --> 00:02:00,100
[JUNE] He has one foot
in the grave already!

50
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,233
You do it!

51
00:02:01,233 --> 00:02:02,767
[IMA] No way!

52
00:02:02,767 --> 00:02:04,700
Attorney, what is all this?

53
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:09,467
[ROMANTIC MUSIC PLAYS]

54
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:11,633
Uh...

55
00:02:12,167 --> 00:02:15,300
I'll just imagine
that our vinegar business

56
00:02:15,333 --> 00:02:17,167
will boom if I do this!

57
00:02:17,167 --> 00:02:22,600
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

58
00:02:22,600 --> 00:02:23,800
[IN UNISON] It's you?!
